+## Failed session initialization
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the orchestrator awaits `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)` before rejecting with that same error, provided those hooks complete normally; no user-input or model processing occurs, and cleanup receives the same session even when initialization only partially completed, so deployers must track successful allocations themselves rather than assuming the turn started ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
+
